WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.271 --> 00:00:02.610
- Whoo-hoo!

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:05.007
I don't know what to say this is.

00:00:05.076 --> 00:00:07.453
(jingle bells)

00:00:07.453 --> 00:00:09.391
- You know, I love candy canes, frankly.

00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:11.051
- I eat a candy cane every day.

00:00:11.051 --> 00:00:13.674
- The candy canes I like the
best are the big thick ones.

00:00:13.674 --> 00:00:15.297
- Oftentimes I'll take a candy cane and

00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:17.935
pop a little bite in and
keep my breath fresh.

00:00:17.935 --> 00:00:20.426
- All right, bring on your darndest.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:25.347
- They always make these
things so hard to open.

00:00:25.985 --> 00:00:27.256
(smacking lips)

00:00:28.303 --> 00:00:31.581
- It's not as minty as I'm accustom to.

00:00:31.811 --> 00:00:33.384
- (smacks lips) Got a coffee flavor to it.

00:00:33.384 --> 00:00:34.410
- It's not horrible.

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:36.631
- Burnt popcorn with butter.

00:00:36.631 --> 00:00:38.894
- Bacon? Oh my goodness.

00:00:38.894 --> 00:00:41.598
I guess I have to try it
again with bacon knowledge.

00:00:41.598 --> 00:00:43.028
- It tasted more like coffee.

00:00:43.465 --> 00:00:46.437
- (laughing) Santa does
not particularly care for

00:00:46.437 --> 00:00:48.893
bacon in his candy.

00:00:50.744 --> 00:00:53.049
- Ooh, Santa.

00:00:53.277 --> 00:00:54.677
(crunching)

00:00:54.891 --> 00:00:56.859
- Mmmm.

00:00:56.934 --> 00:00:59.174
- More crunch, on it.

00:00:59.174 --> 00:01:01.787
Ooh. Ooh my goodness.

00:01:01.787 --> 00:01:03.853
- Well it's not ta ... Oh my goodness.

00:01:03.853 --> 00:01:05.525
- It's got a hot spicy to it.

00:01:05.525 --> 00:01:07.173
- Kind of burnt this side, now
I've got to burn this side.

00:01:07.173 --> 00:01:08.706
Keeps it even (laughs).

00:01:08.706 --> 00:01:09.554
- Pizza.

00:01:09.554 --> 00:01:10.447
Barbecue sauce?

00:01:10.447 --> 00:01:11.271
Hot sauce?

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:12.223
Wasabi?

00:01:12.223 --> 00:01:12.931
- Sriracha sauce.

00:01:12.931 --> 00:01:14.464
- It wakes you up a little bit.

00:01:14.464 --> 00:01:16.623
- I'll probably eat this little piece but,

00:01:16.623 --> 00:01:18.852
it just wasn't what I was expecting.

00:01:18.852 --> 00:01:21.456
- It does not have the
Santa je ne sais quoi.

00:01:21.456 --> 00:01:23.069
- It's not terrible.

00:01:25.136 --> 00:01:26.314
(sniffs)

00:01:26.842 --> 00:01:28.253
(smacks lips)

00:01:28.304 --> 00:01:29.721
- I'm drawing a complete blank.

00:01:29.721 --> 00:01:31.056
There's nothing here.

00:01:31.056 --> 00:01:31.903
- It's not minty.

00:01:31.903 --> 00:01:33.402
- I had a mint flavor.

00:01:33.402 --> 00:01:34.794
- It's a regular candy cane.

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:36.617
- I want to say is it lettuce or celery?

00:01:36.617 --> 00:01:37.661
- Is it pickle?

00:01:37.661 --> 00:01:40.053
- Didn't taste the brine,
didn't taste the pickle.

00:01:40.053 --> 00:01:42.421
- Now I'm starting to
get the pickle flavor.

00:01:42.421 --> 00:01:43.141
- Ew.

00:01:43.141 --> 00:01:45.463
- They're stretching
that one a bit. (laughs)

00:01:47.383 --> 00:01:49.042
- Alright, come on. Open up you.

00:01:49.042 --> 00:01:51.143
- I don't know that I want
to know what this one is.

00:01:51.143 --> 00:01:52.780
- Wooo!

00:01:54.220 --> 00:01:55.682
What the heck is that?

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:56.959
- That one's different.

00:01:56.959 --> 00:01:58.723
- It has quite a kick to it.

00:01:58.723 --> 00:02:00.616
- Glad the stripes aren't brown.

00:02:00.616 --> 00:02:03.262
- That green stuff I get
at the Japanese restaurant.

00:02:03.262 --> 00:02:04.562
- Is that wasabi?

00:02:04.562 --> 00:02:05.735
- Blech.

00:02:05.735 --> 00:02:06.861
- No thank you.

00:02:06.861 --> 00:02:09.050
- Yes. Santa likes.

00:02:10.216 --> 00:02:12.457
- The one with that Vietnamese hot spice,

00:02:12.457 --> 00:02:14.228
I kind of like it. (laughs)

00:02:14.279 --> 00:02:16.020
- The bacon one tasted really good.

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:18.076
- The wasabi, not so much.

00:02:18.076 --> 00:02:20.258
- The wasabi, yes.

00:02:20.258 --> 00:02:24.710
(jingle bells)

